    "title": "<p>Diagnostic criteria for papillary glioneuronal tumour</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Dominique Figarella-Branger",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 446.05pt; border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"0\" width=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><em>Essential:</em></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Biphasic histological and immunophenotypic pattern with pseudopapillary glial lining and interpapillary neuronal components</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>AND</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>PRKCA</em> gene fusion (mostly <em>SLC44A1</em>::<em>PRKCA</em>)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>AND (for unresolved lesions)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 36.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"49\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 409.25pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"546\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Methylation profile of papillary glioneuronal tumour</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.05pt; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><em>Desirable:</em></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.05pt; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Well-delineated, solid and cystic tumour</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Caveat:</strong> Diagnosis should be heavily weighted towards molecular findings because morphological analyses frequently result in mistyping <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{30759284}</span>.</p>",
